,61.68,61.86],["got",61.86,62.0],["some",62.0,62.16],["very",62.16,62.42],["interesting",62.42,62.96]]},{"start":62.96,"end":68.16,"text":"results. Obviously, we need to start by saying that we interviewed all the third-year students","words":[["results.",62.96,63.34],["Obviously,",64.38,64.78],["we",64.9,65.02],["need",65.02,65.12],["to",65.12,65.26],["start",65.26,65.52],["by",65.52,65.74],["saying",65.74,66.04],["that",66.04,66.24],["we",66.24,66.34],["interviewed",66.34,66.82],["all",66.82,67.1],["the",67.1,67.24],["third",67.24,67.5],["-year",67.5,67.7],["students",67.7,68.16]]},{"start":68.16,"end":74.02,"text":"doing a music degree and state the objective of our research project, that is, to find out about","words":[["doing",68.16,68.6],["a",68.6,68.84],["music",68.84,69.08],["degree",69.08,69.5],["and",69.5,70.18],["state",70.18,70.48],["the",70.48,70.62],["objective",70.62,71.06],["of",71.06,71.32],["our",71.32,71.48],["research",71.48,71.86],["project,",71.86,72.38],["that",72.68,72.92],["is,",72.92,73.16],["to",73.26,73.4],["find",73.4,73.62],["out",73.62,73.78],["about",73.78,74.02]]},{"start":74.02,"end":78.92,"text":"their attitudes to performing. And then we should talk about the students' musical backgrounds","words":[["their",74.02,74.22],["attitudes",74.22,74.76],["to",74.76,75.08],["performing.",75.08,75.5],["And",76.06,76.32],["then",76.32,76.5],["we",76.5,76.68],["should",76.68,76.82],["talk",76.82,77.02],["about",77.02,77.24],["the",77.24,77.38],["students'",77.38,77.68],["musical",77.92,78.3],["backgrounds",78.3,78.92]]},{"start":78.92,"end":84.76,"text":"before coming to university. The most important points to make are that, although most people","words":[["before",78.92,79.52],["coming",79.52,79.88],["to",79.88,80.06],["university.",80.06,80.64],["The",81.32,81.56],["most",81.56,81.8],["important",81.8,82.26],["points",82.26,82.64],["to",82.64,82.92],["make",82.92,83.24],["are",83.24,83.56],["that,",83.56,83.7],["although",83.82,84.12],["most",84.12,84.46],["people",84.46,84.76]]},{"start":84.76,"end":90.4,"text":"have actually composed music during the course, that wasn't the case when they arrived. And","words":[["have",84.76,84.92],["actually",84.92,85.26],["composed",85.26,85.64],["music",85.64,86.32],["during",86.32,86.6],["the",86.6,86.82],["course,",86.82,87.22],["that",87.62,87.78],["wasn't",87.78,88.22],["the",88.22,88.34],["case",88.34,88.58],["when",88.58,88.74],["they",88.74,88.9],["arrived.",88.9,89.32],["And",90.08,90.4]]},{"start":90.4,"end":92.58,"text":"And the other thing they had in common was the piano.","words":[["And",90.4,90.44],["the",90.44,90.56],["other",90.56,90.76],["thing",90.76,91.02],["they",91.02,91.2],["had",91.2,91.4],["in",91.4,91.56],["common",91.56,91.84],["was",91.84,92.1],["the",92.1,92.26],["piano.",92.26,92.58]]},{"start":93.16,"end":98.18,"text":"Well, they'd had access to a piano at some point, but not all had studied it formally.","words":[["Well,",93.16,93.42],["they'd",93.6,93.88],["had",93.88,94.04],["access",94.04,94.44],["to",94.44,94.72],["a",94.72,94.8],["piano",94.8,95.08],["at",95.08,95.28],["some",95.28,95.54],["point,",95.54,95.94],["but",96.32,96.54],["not",96.54,96.68],["all",96.68,96.96],["had",96.96,97.2],["studied",97.2,97.56],["it",97.56,97.8],["formally.",97.8,98.18]]},{"start":99.14,"end":103.64,"text":"I thought the most interesting finding was that before coming here, almost everyone","words":[["I",99.14,99.36],["thought",99.36,99.5],["the",99.5,99.62],["most",99.62,99.78],["interesting",99.78,100.42],["finding",100.42,100.88],["was",100.88,101.2],["that",101.2,101.36],["before",101.36,101.68],["coming",101.68,102.02],["here,",102.02,102.4],["almost",102.8,103.08],["everyone",103.08,103.64]]},{"start":103.64,"end":109.0,"text":"was involved in a chamber orchestra or band or singing in a choir and playing in front","words":[["was",103.64,103.94],["involved",103.94,104.3],["in",104.3,104.54],["a",104.54,104.68],["chamber",104.68,105.08],["orchestra",105.08,105.54],["or",105.54,106.02],["band",106.02,106.44],["or",106.44,107.08],["singing",107.08,107.42],["in",107.42,107.66],["a",107.66,107.78],["choir",107.78,108.1],["and",108.1,108.38],["playing",108.38,108.62],["in",108.62,108.86],["front",108.86,109.0]]},{"start":109.0,"end":110.18,"text":"of live audiences.","words":[["of",109.0,109.2],["live",109.2,109.5],["audiences.",109.5,110.18]]},{"start":110.64,"end":112.76,"text":"But varying enormously in size.","words":[["But",110.64,110.92],["varying",110.92,111.5],["enormously",111.5,112.08],["in",112.08,112.44],["size.",112.44,112.76]]},{"start":113.4,"end":115.4,"text":"Some had only played in tiny venues.","words":[["Some",113.4,113.82],["had",113.82,113.98],["only",113.98,114.16],["played",114.16,114.42],["in",114.42,114.62],["tiny",114.62,114.98],["venues.",114.98,115.4]]},{"start":116.04,"end":117.6,"text":"I think it's worth saying that.","words":[["I",116.04,116.34],["think",116.34,116.48],["it's",116.48,116.72],["worth",116.72,116.92],["saying",116.92,117.26],["that.",117.26,117.6]]},{"start":117.88,"end":118.1,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",117.88,118.1]]},{"start":118.1,"end":124.5,"text":"way. And as you might expect from people wanting to study music, they all had a degree of proficiency","words":[["way.",118.1,118.18],["And",118.78,119.24],["as",119.24,119.38],["you",119.38,119.5],["might",119.5,119.62],["expect",119.62,120.12],["from",120.12,120.42],["people",120.42,120.72],["wanting",120.72,121.04],["to",121.04,121.3],["study",121.3,121.58],["music,",121.58,122.06],["they",122.6,122.84],["all",122.84,123.06],["had",123.06,123.34],["a",123.34,123.44],["degree",123.44,123.72],["of",123.72,123.92],["proficiency",123.92,124.5]]},{"start":124.5,"end":129.86,"text":"in at least two instruments. But in most cases, one of the instruments was dominant.","words":[["in",124.5,124.94],["at",124.94,125.08],["least",125.08,125.3],["two",125.3,125.76],["instruments.",125.76,126.34],["But",126.96,127.22],["in",127.22,127.32],["most",127.32,127.52],["cases,",127.52,128.04],["one",128.22,128.5],["of",128.5,128.64],["the",128.64,128.76],["instruments",128.76,129.18],["was",129.18,129.46],["dominant.",129.46,129.86]]},{"start":130.16,"end":136.76,"text":"Right. We need to talk about attitudes to music practice. The most striking thing here","words":[["Right.",130.16,130.5],["We",131.44,131.76],["need",131.76,132.06],["to",132.06,132.32],["talk",132.32,132.54],["about",132.54,132.74],["attitudes",132.74,133.44],["to",133.44,133.78],["music",133.78,134.12],["practice.",134.12,134.64],["The",135.38,135.56],["most",135.56,135.74],["striking",135.74,136.16],["thing",136.16,136.46],["here",136.46,136.76]]},{"start":136.76,"end":141.7,"text":"is that even students who you'd expect to practice for hours every day until they get","words":[["is",136.76,136.92],["that",136.92,137.08],["even",137.08,137.36],["students",137.36,137.84],["who",137.84,138.18],["you'd",138.18,138.34],["expect",138.34,138.74],["to",138.74,139.04],["practice",139.04,139.38],["for",139.38,139.7],["hours",139.7,140.02],["every",140.02,140.36],["day",140.36,140.74],["until",140.74,141.1],["they",141.1,141.46],["get",141.46,141.7]]},{"start":141.7,"end":147.64,"text":"it perfect say it's being terrified of failing that really makes them practice. I know I'm","words":[["it",141.7,141.84],["perfect",141.84,142.28],["say",142.28,143.02],["it's",143.02,143.3],["being",143.3,143.54],["terrified",143.54,144.14],["of",144.14,144.44],["failing",144.44,144.86],["that",144.86,145.2],["really",145.2,145.64],["makes",145.64,146.0],["them",146.0,146.16],["practice.",146.16,146.56],["I",147.04,147.3],["know",147.3,147.44],["I'm",147.44,147.64]]},{"start":147.64,"end":153.96,"text":"the same. Me too. It's interesting what was said about practicing alone. Some people preferred","words":[["the",147.64,147.74],["same.",147.74,148.08],["Me",148.36,148.72],["too.",148.72,149.02],["It's",149.8,150.08],["interesting",150.08,150.52],["what",150.52,150.76],["was",150.76,150.9],["said",150.9,151.08],["about",151.08,151.32],["practicing",151.32,151.82],["alone.",151.82,152.3],["Some",153.0,153.28],["people",153.28,153.58],["preferred",153.58,153.96]]},{"start":153.96,"end":158.96,"text":"that because they could focus more on their weak points. But that wasn't a majority view.","words":[["that",153.96,154.34],["because",154.34,154.92],["they",154.92,155.12],["could",155.12,155.24],["focus",155.24,155.58],["more",155.58,155.84],["on",155.84,156.0],["their",156.0,156.14],["weak",156.14,156.32],["points.",156.32,156.8],["But",157.16,157.34],["that",157.34,157.56],["wasn't",157.56,157.98],["a",157.98,158.1],["majority",158.1,158.48],["view.",158.48,158.96]]},{"start":159.72,"end":164.2,"text":"What most of them agree on is that there's nothing more rewarding than mastering something","words":[["What",159.72,160.0],["most",160.0,160.36],["of",160.36,160.54],["them",160.54,160.68],["agree",160.68,160.88],["on",160.88,161.24],["is",161.24,161.5],["that",161.5,161.68],["there's",161.68,161.92],["nothing",161.92,162.22],["more",162.22,162.5],["rewarding",162.5,163.04],["than",163.04,163.26],["mastering",163.26,163.72],["something",163.72,164.2]]},{"start":164.2,"end":170.18,"text":"that's really hard to learn. That's right. Okay, after that we should talk a bit about","words":[["that's",164.2,164.54],["really",164.54,164.86],["hard",164.86,165.18],["to",165.18,165.38],["learn.",165.38,165.72],["That's",165.9,166.18],["right.",166.18,166.42],["Okay,",167.4,167.76],["after",168.18,168.6],["that",168.6,168.9],["we",168.9,169.16],["should",169.16,169.34],["talk",169.34,169.6],["a",169.6,169.76],["bit",169.76,169.88],["about",169.88,170.18]]},{"start":170.18,"end":174.82,"text":"the pieces that students select for assessed performances. There wasn't quite so much","words":[["the",170.18,170.34],["pieces",170.34,170.66],["that",170.66,170.9],["students",170.9,171.26],["select",171.26,171.7],["for",171.7,1