ds":[["try",191.94,192.16],["to",192.16,192.34],["learn",192.34,192.6],["their",192.6,192.78],["pieces",192.78,193.06],["by",193.06,193.38],["heart,",193.38,193.88],["because",194.2,194.56],["it's",194.56,194.8],["too",194.8,194.94],["easy",194.94,195.22],["to",195.22,195.36],["get",195.36,195.52],["lost",195.52,195.82],["if",195.82,196.04],["you're",196.04,196.2],["trying",196.2,196.42]]},{"start":196.42,"end":198.26,"text":"to read and play when you're nervous.","words":[["to",196.42,196.56],["read",196.56,196.86],["and",196.86,197.16],["play",197.16,197.54],["when",197.54,197.76],["you're",197.76,197.96],["nervous.",197.96,198.26]]},{"start":198.82,"end":204.1,"text":"Okay. And quite a lot of them said it helps to listen to other people playing your","words":[["Okay.",198.82,199.08],["And",199.86,200.38],["quite",200.38,200.72],["a",200.72,200.98],["lot",200.98,201.12],["of",201.12,201.32],["them",201.32,201.46],["said",201.46,201.74],["it",201.74,201.88],["helps",201.88,202.14],["to",202.14,202.4],["listen",202.4,202.68],["to",202.68,202.9],["other",202.9,203.12],["people",203.12,203.44],["playing",203.44,203.82],["your",203.82,204.1]]},{"start":204.1,"end":208.68,"text":"chosen piece, preferably recordings but even just other students.","words":[["chosen",204.1,204.52],["piece,",204.52,204.82],["preferably",205.34,205.74],["recordings",205.74,206.36],["but",206.36,206.98],["even",206.98,207.56],["just",207.56,207.94],["other",207.94,208.2],["students.",208.2,208.68]]},{"start":212.2,"end":217.58,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 27","words":[["Before",212.2,212.56],["you",212.56,212.82],["hear",212.82,213.08],["the",213.08,213.24],["rest",213.24,213.52],["of",213.52,213.66],["the",213.66,213.76],["discussion,",213.76,214.22],["you",214.84,215.12],["have",215.12,215.3],["some",215.3,215.52],["time",215.52,215.82],["to",215.82,216.02],["look",216.02,216.16],["at",216.16,216.28],["questions",216.28,216.58],["27",216.58,217.58]]},{"start":217.58,"end":244.06,"text":"to 30 on page 6. Now listen and answer questions 27 to 30.","words":[["to",217.58,217.8],["30",217.8,218.24],["on",218.24,219.1],["page",219.1,219.42],["6.",219.42,219.92],["Now",240.22,240.5],["listen",240.5,240.86],["and",240.86,241.72],["answer",241.72,242.06],["questions",242.06,242.42],["27",242.42,243.42],["to",243.42,243.64],["30.",243.64,244.06]]},{"start":247.46,"end":253.34,"text":"So finally we need to look at the findings for students attitudes to performing. We","words":[["So",247.46,247.96],["finally",247.96,248.5],["we",248.5,249.06],["need",249.06,249.26],["to",249.26,249.46],["look",249.46,249.64],["at",249.64,249.76],["the",249.76,249.86],["findings",249.86,250.2],["for",250.2,250.54],["students",250.54,250.84],["attitudes",250.84,251.48],["to",251.48,251.8],["performing.",251.8,252.26],["We",252.98,253.34]]},{"start":253.34,"end":258.88,"text":"should point out that this includes informal and formal public performances as well as","words":[["should",253.34,253.62],["point",253.62,253.92],["out",253.92,254.28],["that",254.28,254.48],["this",254.48,254.68],["includes",254.68,255.16],["informal",255.16,255.76],["and",255.76,256.22],["formal",256.22,256.6],["public",256.6,257.02],["performances",257.02,257.7],["as",257.7,258.28],["well",258.28,258.66],["as",258.66,258.88]]},{"start":258.88,"end":259.52,"text":"assessed ones.","words":[["assessed",258.88,259.12],["ones.",259.12,259.52]]},{"start":259.88,"end":265.46,"text":"Yes, that's important. I expected to find that performing solo would make students","words":[["Yes,",259.88,260.2],["that's",260.48,260.76],["important.",260.76,261.2],["I",262.18,262.44],["expected",262.44,262.9],["to",262.9,263.18],["find",263.18,263.38],["that",263.38,263.56],["performing",263.56,263.86],["solo",263.86,264.46],["would",264.46,264.76],["make",264.76,265.02],["students",265.02,265.46]]},{"start":265.46,"end":268.24,"text":"very nervous, but in fact that isn't the case.","words":[["very",265.46,265.9],["nervous,",265.9,266.34],["but",266.74,266.96],["in",266.96,267.08],["fact",267.08,267.36],["that",267.36,267.54],["isn't",267.54,267.84],["the",267.84,267.92],["case.",267.92,268.24]]},{"start":268.72,"end":273.5,"text":"They do find it hugely challenging to start with, but they appreciate the challenge and","words":[["They",268.72,268.92],["do",268.92,269.14],["find",269.14,269.4],["it",269.4,269.54],["hugely",269.54,269.9],["challenging",269.9,270.46],["to",270.46,270.72],["start",270.72,270.96],["with,",270.96,271.26],["but",271.66,271.96],["they",271.96,272.14],["appreciate",272.14,272.62],["the",272.62,272.88],["challenge",272.88,273.22],["and",273.22,273.5]]},{"start":273.5,"end":274.36,"text":"find it stimulating.","words":[["find",273.5,273.76],["it",273.76,273.92],["stimulating.",273.92,274.36]]},{"start":275.04,"end":280.18,"text":"Right. I was surprised by what students said about deciding which pieces to perform.","words":[["Right.",275.04,275.36],["I",276.36,276.58],["was",276.58,276.66],["surprised",276.66,277.0],["by",277.0,277.24],["what",277.24,277.36],["students",277.36,277.68],["said",277.68,278.04],["about",278.04,278.28],["deciding",278.28,278.9],["which",278.9,279.22],["pieces",279.22,279.56],["to",279.56,279.8],["perform.",279.8,280.18]]},{"start":280.8,"end":284.86,"text":"I thought they'd all say this was easy. For me it's always being quite straightforward.","words":[["I",280.8,281.06],["thought",281.06,281.24],["they'd",281.24,281.42],["all",281.42,281.52],["say",281.52,281.76],["this",281.76,281.94],["was",281.94,282.08],["easy.",282.08,282.44],["For",282.98,283.12],["me",283.12,283.28],["it's",283.28,283.52],["always",283.52,283.72],["being",283.72,284.06],["quite",284.06,284.34],["straightforward.",284.34,284.86]]},{"start":284.86,"end":290.66,"text":"forward. Which pieces do I like best? And which pieces can I play well? And my repertoire","words":[["forward.",284.86,285.08],["Which",285.46,285.72],["pieces",285.72,286.08],["do",286.08,286.36],["I",286.36,286.46],["like",286.46,286.7],["best?",286.7,287.08],["And",287.62,287.76],["which",287.76,287.94],["pieces",287.94,288.3],["can",288.3,288.48],["I",288.48,288.62],["play",288.62,288.86],["well?",288.86,289.18],["And",289.78,290.06],["my",290.06,290.28],["repertoire",290.28,290.66]]},{"start":290.66,"end":295.78,"text":"is quite limited anyway. But the most commonly cited answer was that it took them ages to","words":[["is",290.66,291.0],["quite",291.0,291.18],["limited",291.18,291.62],["anyway.",291.62,291.96],["But",292.54,292.72],["the",292.72,292.8],["most",292.8,293.0],["commonly",293.0,293.46],["cited",293.46,293.86],["answer",293.86,294.34],["was",294.34,294.56],["that",294.56,294.76],["it",294.76,294.92],["took",294.92,295.06],["them",295.06,295.22],["ages",295.22,295.52],["to",295.52,295.78]]},{"start":295.78,"end":296.66,"text":"make their minds up.","words":[["make",295.78,295.9],["their",295.9,296.06],["minds",296.06,296.36],["up.",296.36,296.66]]},{"start":296.88,"end":302.06,"text":"I suppose it's because there are so many factors involved. You need to consider your","words":[["I",296.88,297.04],["suppose",297.04,297.44],["it's",297.44,297.74],["because",297.74,297.94],["there",297.94,298.16],["are",298.16,298.26],["so",298.26,298.54],["many",298.54,298.84],["factors",298.84,299.3],["involved.",299.3,299.86],["You",300.68,300.98],["need",300.98,301.18],["to",301.18,301.36],["consider",301.36,301.78],["your",301.78,302.06]]},{"start":302.06,"end":307.5,"text":"audience, the venue, the time available to learn the piece, especially if it's complicated.","words":[["audience,",302.06,302.66],["the",303.06,303.16],["venue,",303.16,303.54],["the",304.06,304.22],["time",304.22,304.52],["available",304.52,304.8],["to",304.8,305.14],["learn",305.14,305.44],["the",305.44,305.64],["piece,",305.64,306.14],["especially",306.26,306.66],["if",306.66,306.9],["it's",306.9,307.06],["complicated.",307.06,307.5]]},{"start":308.36,"end":312.38,"text":"You need to think about all these things, and you can't do that in a hurry.","words":[["You",308.36,308.7],["need",308.7,308.88],["to",308.88,309.02],["think",309.02,309.2],["about",309.2,309.4],["all",309.4,309.8],["these",309.8,310.04],["things,",310.04,310.48],["and",310.8,311.06],["you",311.06,311.22],["can't",311.22,311.56],["do",311.56,311.68],["that",311.68,311.88],["in",311.88,312.02],["a",312.02,312.12],["hurry.",312.12,312.38]]},{"start":312.88,"end":313.44,"text":"That's true.","words":[["That's",312.88,313.18],["true.",313.18,313.44]]},{"start":313.44,"end":318.92,"text":"Then there's performing with musicians from a different genre, like a classical musician","words":[["Then",313.44,314.4],["there's",314.4,314.84],["performing",314.84,315.22],["with",315.22,315.58],["musicians",315.58,315.98],["from",315.98,316.28],["a",316.28,316.44],["different",316.44,316.66],["genre,",316.66,317.12],["like",317.28,317.68],["a",317.68,317.86],["classical",317.86,318.3],["musician",318.3,318.92]]},{"start":318.92,"end":321.72,"text":"playing with a jazz group. That can really be fun.","words":[["playing",318.92,319.46],["with",319.46,319.66],["a",319.66,319.78],["jazz",319.78,320.02],["group.",320.02,320.3],["That",320.62,320.82],["can",320.82,320.98],["really",320.98,321.22],["be",321.22,321.38],["fun.",321.38,321.72]]},{"start":322.2,"end":325.58,"text":"But most of the music students had never even considered it.","words":[["But",322.2,322.44],["most",322.44,322.78],["of",322.78,322.94],["the",322.94,323.04],["music",323.04,323.28],["students",323.28,323.8],["had",323.8,324.22],["never",324.22,324.5],["even",324.5,324.74],["considered",324.74,325.3],["it.",325.3,325.58]]},{"start":325.74,"end":329.96,"text":"Right. For performing with musicians who play the same instrument,","words":[["Right.",325.74,326.08],["For",326.92,327.14],["performing",327.14,327.56],["with",327.56,327.84],["musicians",327.84,328.34],["who",328.34,328.74],["play",328.74,329.02],["the",329.02,329.18],["same",329.18,329.42],["instrument,",329.42,329.96]]},{"start":330.18,"end":332.14,"text":"almost everyone put the same thing.","words":[["almost",330.18,330.38],["everyone",330.38,331.1],["put",331.1,331.44],["the",331.44,331.58],["same",331.58,331.86],["thing.",331.86,332.14]]},{"start":332.38,"end":336.92,"text":"Yes, they all said it was incredibly helpful and not at all intimidating,","words":[["Yes,",332.38,332.62],["they",333.0,333.2],["all",333.2,333.36],["said",333.36,333.6],["it",333.6,333.78],["was",333.78,333.9],["incredibly",333.9,334.36],["helpful",334.36,334.94],["and",334.94,335.76],["not",335.76,335.92],["at",335.92,336.04],["all",336.04,336.28],["intimidating,",336.28,336.92]]},{"start":336.92,"end":339.42,"text":"which says a lot for the department's ethos.","words":[["which",336.92,337.66],["says",337.66,337.9],["a",337.9,338.06],["lot",338.06,338.26],["for",338.26,338.46],["the",338.46,338.52],["department's",338.52,339.12],["ethos.",339.12,339.42]]},{"start":339.42,"end":340.96,"text":"Yes, that's a good point.","words":[["Yes,",339.42,339.96],["that's",340.24,340.48],["a",340.48,340.54],["good",340.54,340.66],["point.",340.66,340.96]]},{"start":341.72,"end":344.5,"text":"Okay, what I think we should sort out now.","words":[["Okay,",341.72,342.04],["what",342.52,342.92],["I",342.92,343.22],["think",343.22,343.46],["we",343.46,343.62],["should",343.62,343.76],["sort",343.76,343.96],["out",343.96,344.2],["now.",344.2,344.5]]},{"start":348.15,"end":350.09,"text":"That is the end of section 3.","words":[["That",348.15,348.49],["is",348.49,348.67],["the",348.67,348.83],["end",348.83,349.09],["of",349.09,349.25],["section",349.25,349.55],["3.",349.55,350.09]]},{"start":350.99,"end":353.39,"text":"You now have half a minute to check your answers.","words":[["You",350.99,351.19],["now",351.19,351.41],["have",351.41,351.65],["half",351.65,351.91],["a",351.91,352.03],["minute",352.03,352.23],["to",352.23,352.45],["check",352.45,352.73],["your",352.73,353.01],["answers.",353.01,353.39]]},{"start":383.87,"end":386.71,"text":"Now turn to section 4 on page 7.","words":[["Now",383.87,384.17],["turn",384.17,384.45],["to",384.45,384.65],["section",384.65,384.97],["4",384.97,385.47],["on",385.47,385.99],["page",385.99,386.27],["7.",386.27,386.71]]}]}